[00:10.10]Jehovah, dear Father,
[00:14.04]There seemed no hope for us.
[00:19.11]The ransom has given
[00:22.14]Hope to ev’ryone!
[00:28.22]We give our lives to you,
[00:32.84]Our best in all we do.
[00:37.40]And we’ll tell others too,
[00:41.12]That your will might be done.
[00:44.74](Chorus)
[00:44.89]You gave your precious Son,
[00:49.96]And now we sing as one,
[00:54.48]A song we’ll sing forever,
[00:59.18]for giving us your precious Son.
[01:09.22]Your kindness, your mercy,
[01:13.44]They draw us close to you.
[01:18.42]Your great name, your friendship,
[01:22.58]These we’ve come to love.
[01:27.59]But something more than this
[01:32.10]Is your most precious gift.
[01:35.84]He died that we might live.
[01:40.10]You sent him from above.
[01:44.37](Chorus)
[01:44.52]You gave your precious Son,
[01:48.64]And now we sing as one,
[01:53.78]A song we’ll sing forever,
[01:58.36]for giving us your precious Son.
[03:12.25](Ending)
[03:12.40]Jehovah, dear Father, we pray in gratitude.
[03:20.92]We offer our thanks for giving us your precious Son.
